  "details": "- Rebase to upstream 6.9.13.50, matching EPEL 8 ImageMagick-6.9.13.50-1.el8\n- Drop the TuxCare CVE patches whose fixes are included in the upstream\n  6.9.13.50 release\n- Keep the MSL empty-image crash fix (partial backport of upstream\n  fde1f305, not present in the legacy 6.x line)\n- CVE-2026-45664: free the chunk buffer on the MNG LOOP/ENDL op-cap abort\n  path (upstream dd198f960, not yet included in 6.9.13.50) to prevent a\n  heap memory leak when the loop-operation limit is hit",
